    "sections": [
      {
        "text": "Descriptive batting and bowling profiles from official ball-by-ball data, for IPL and T20I separately, over the pre-test window (2022 to 2025). Counts, rates, splits and match-bootstrap uncertainty on the main rate. There is no composite score and no ordering of players.",
        "title": "What is published"
      },
      {
        "text": "A Top 10 list of pressure batters or bowlers. The pressure measure cannot separate individual players with the available data, so no list is shown and no list is padded.",
        "title": "What is not published"
      },
      {
        "text": "Runs, strike rate, economy and wickets are descriptive. They describe what happened and are not a statement about performance under pressure. The only pressure-related columns are counts of deliveries that fall in a provisional context definition.",
        "title": "Descriptive versus pressure statistics"
      },
      {
        "text": "Official ball-by-ball rows only; innings 3 and 4 (super overs) are excluded from regulation metrics; wides and the Penalty row are not balls faced or legal balls; bowler wickets are bowler-credited only; DLS-affected rows are kept and counted; OTHER_T20 is not profiled; TEST-period matches are never read.",
        "title": "Data rules"
      }
